apeutics-inc-axsm-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AXSM 2020 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Herriot Tabuteau","x":"And we would look to -- and in fact, we are looking to leverage that safety database, that rich safety database, to accelerate or streamline our filings for AXS-12 and AXS-14.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/axsome-therapeutics-inc-axsm-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"AXSM 2021 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2021-05-10","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Herriot Tabuteau","x":"And we recently had a significant presence with the American Psychiatric Association where we had a sponsored product theater based around the unmet need within MDD, the limitations of current treatments and future directions in terms of clinical development.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/axsome-therapeutics-inc-axsm-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AXSM 2021 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2021-05-10","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Herriot Tabuteau","x":"And by all accounts based on metrics we received from the American Psychiatric Association, excellent product theater was among the best attended at that conference.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/axsome-therapeutics-inc-axsm-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"AXSM 2022 Q3","e":"axsm","d":"2022-11-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Graig Suvannavejh","x":"But my question has to do with kind of are there plans in the works right now for thinking about a direct to consumer campaign, just any other color on additional marketing and advertising plans for Auvelity?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/07/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q3-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2023 Q2","e":"axsm","d":"2023-08-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Herriot Tabuteau","x":"In conjunction with our digital centric commercialization or DTC platform, the expansion should nearly double the number of prescribers we are able to reach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q2-2023-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2023 Q2","e":"axsm","d":"2023-08-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Lori Englebert","x":"We significantly invested in HCP and DTC directed media with the updated campaign and are seeing immediate results from these promotional efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/07/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q2-2023-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2023 Q4","e":"axsm","d":"2024-02-20","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"As you know, we do have a DTC effort today largely focused on digital engagement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/20/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q4-2023-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2023 Q4","e":"axsm","d":"2024-02-20","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Graig Suvannavejh","x":"One, just can you comment on the Auvelity DTC efforts?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/20/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q4-2023-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2024-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"Well, we have DTC largely in the digital space at the moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/06/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q1-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2024-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Ram Selvaraju","x":"Have you started doing DTC promotion of Auvelity?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/06/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q1-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q2","e":"axsm","d":"2024-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"You broke up a little bit, but I believe the first question was plans on direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/05/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q2-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q2","e":"axsm","d":"2024-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"You know, we obviously have direct-to-consumer end market right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/05/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q2-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q2","e":"axsm","d":"2024-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Marc Goodman","x":"Is the plan still to do a DTC advertising campaign in the second half-ish [Technical difficulty] And then also, just update us on the marketing, like, plans to spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/05/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q2-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q4","e":"axsm","d":"2025-02-18","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Ram Selvaraju","x":"With respect to DTC promotional activities, whether those are for Auvelity or Symbravo, can you comment on the cadence with which you expect those to be initiated?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/18/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q4-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2024 Q4","e":"axsm","d":"2025-02-18","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Ram Selvaraju","x":"And what strategies you might employ in order to optimize the efficiency of DTC buys?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/18/axsome-therapeutics-axsm-q4-2024-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2025-05-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"Regarding DTC, we expect to launch a national campaign later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/axsome-axsm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2025-05-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Nick Pizzie","x":"We have the DTC campaign that's going to be occurring later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/axsome-axsm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q1","e":"axsm","d":"2025-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Herriot Tabuteau","x":"While we are closely monitoring trade policy developments, including proposed pharmaceutical tariffs, we believe that any potential impact to our business would be immaterial.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/axsome-axsm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q3","e":"axsm","d":"2025-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Nick Pizzie","x":"…and administrative expenses of $150.2 million increased 57% compared to last year, primarily driven by commercialization activities for AUVELITY including the sales force expansion and our recently launched direct-to-consumer advertising campaign, along with the commercial launch of SYMBRAVO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/axsome-axsm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q3","e":"axsm","d":"2025-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"And then finally, our direct-to-consumer campaign, which launched in the quarter, we're seeing early positive signals in terms of patient awareness, patient requests for the product, and we expect that to facilitate further growth in the primary care setting along with the psychiatry setting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/axsome-axsm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q3","e":"axsm","d":"2025-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Nick Pizzie","x":"That was really driven by our launch of the DTC campaign that we launched in September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/axsome-axsm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q3","e":"axsm","d":"2025-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Ari Maizel","x":"As it relates to DTC, I think it's a little premature to talk about potential timing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/axsome-axsm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXSM 2025 Q4","e":"axsm","d":"2026-02-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Nick Pizzie",